-   entry .iso8601InstantDecodable   reads ISO 8601 date-times, dates, months and week dates, with `Z` or an offset
-       `Iso8601.parse`: `1994-11-06T08:49:37Z`, `2023-05-28T14:30:59.123+02:00`, the basic
-       form `20230528T143059Z`, `2023-W21-7T14:30:59Z`, a date `2020-12-31` or a month
-       `2012-11` (midnight UTC), hours alone or hours and minutes, a fraction on the last
-       field, and a leap second `23:59:60`, which lands on the following second.
-   entry .rfc1123InstantDecodable   reads RFC 1123 date-times, `Tue, 17 Jun 2024 14:30:45 GMT`
-       `Rfc1123.parse`: the form HTTP headers use, with a two-digit day and `GMT`.
+   entry .iso8601InstantDecodable   lê data-horas, datas, meses e datas de semana ISO 8601, com `Z` ou um deslocamento
+       `Iso8601.parse`: `1994-11-06T08:49:37Z`, `2023-05-28T14:30:59.123+02:00`, a forma
+       básica `20230528T143059Z`, `2023-W21-7T14:30:59Z`, uma data `2020-12-31` ou um mês
+       `2012-11` (meia-noite UTC), só as horas ou horas e minutos, uma fração no último campo,
+       e um segundo bissexto `23:59:60`, que cai no segundo seguinte.
+   entry .rfc1123InstantDecodable   lê data-horas RFC 1123, `Tue, 17 Jun 2024 14:30:45 GMT`
+       `Rfc1123.parse`: a forma usada pelos cabeçalhos HTTP, com um dia de dois dígitos e `GMT`.

